<title>USA: HFS ends pact to acquire MItsubishi unit.</title>
<headline>HFS ends pact to acquire MItsubishi unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc and Mitsubishi Motor Sales of America, a unit of Mitsubishi Motors Corp, said Friday that they have ended their previously-aanounced agreement in principle for HFS to acquire Mitsubishi's Value Rent-A-Car subsidiary.</p>
<p>Neither company said why the deal was called off.</p>
<p>HFS, in other news, did say that its merger with PHH Corp is expected to close shortly.</p>
</text>
